  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Bump libkrunfw to the guest kernel with conntrack marks so nft ct mark rules load by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1493\n* Stop the workload wait ticker without waiting out its sleep by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1495\n* Pin libkrunfw to the merged conntrack-mark commit on main by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1494\n* Restrict serve mTLS clients by certificate subject CN by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1499\n* Speed up restored starts with --keep-identity and RAM prefetch by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1497\n* Preserve HTTP machine records when storage cleanup fails by @hfiguera in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1498\n* Give machine update the --outbound-localhost-only flag create has by @BABTUNA in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1500\n* Prefetch restored RAM and allow keep-identity restores in the embedded runtime by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1502\n* Bump the workspace to 1.22.1 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1496\n\n## New Contributors\n* @hfiguera made their first contribution in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1498\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.22.0...v1.22.1",
